    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.ui.core.dnd.DragDropInfo</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.ui.core.dnd.DragDropInfo
    "! Provides the configuration for drag-and-drop operations. Note: This
    "! configuration might be ignored due to control metadata restrictions.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter source_aggregation           | (string) The name of the aggregation from which all children can be
    "!                         dragged. If undefined, the control itself can be dragged.
    "! @parameter target_aggregation           | (string) The aggregation name in the drop target control which is the
    "!                         target of this drag-and-drop action. If undefined, the entire control is
    "!                         the target. This can be handy if the target control does not have any
    "!                         aggregations or if the drop position within the target does not matter.
    "! @parameter drop_effect                  | (sap.ui.core.dnd.DropEffect) Defines the visual drop effect. Default: Move.
    "! @parameter drop_position                | (sap.ui.core.dnd.DropPosition) Defines the position for the drop action,
    "!                         visualized by a rectangle. Default: On.
    "! @parameter drop_layout                  | (sap.ui.core.dnd.DropLayout) Defines the layout of the droppable controls
    "!                         if dropPosition is set to Between or OnOrBetween . Default: Default.
    "! @parameter group_name                   | (string) Defines the name of the group to which this object belongs. If
    "!                         groupName is specified, then this object will only interacts with other
    "!                         drag-and-drop objects within the same group.
    "! @parameter enabled                      | (boolean) Indicates whether this configuration is active or not. Default:
    "!                         true.
    "! @parameter keyboard_handling            | (boolean) Indicates limited keyboard handling support for drag-and-drop
    "!                         configurations defined for aggregation reordering. Note: If the
    "!                         drag-and-drop configuration is defined for the aggregation reordering of a
    "!                         control (only if the dropPosition property is Between ), the Ctrl/Cmd +
    "!                         Left/Right keys for horizontal move or the Ctrl/Cmd + Up/Down keys for
    "!                         vertical move trigger a series of pseudo drag-and-drop events, such as
    "!                         dragstart, dragenter, drop, dragend , to create an artificial drag-and-drop
    "!                         action. This keyboard handling might not be suitable for every control
    "!                         where aggregation reordering is defined, and in such cases, this property
    "!                         must not be set to true . Default: false.
    "! @parameter drag_start                   | (event) This event is fired when the user starts dragging an element.
    "! @parameter drag_end                     | (event) This event is fired when a drag operation is being ended.
    "! @parameter drag_enter                   | (event) This event is fired when a dragged element enters a drop target.
    "! @parameter drag_over                    | (event) This event is fired when an element is being dragged over a valid
    "!                         drop target.
    "! @parameter drop                         | (event) This event is fired when an element is dropped on a valid drop
    "!                         target, as specified by the drag-and-drop info.
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS drag_drop_info
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        source_aggregation           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        target_aggregation           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        drop_effect                  TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        drop_position                TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        drop_layout                  TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        group_name                   TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        enabled                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        keyboard_handling            TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        drag_start                   TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        drag_end                     TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        drag_enter                   TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        drag_over                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        drop                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

