    "! @parameter ns                           | (string) Namespace prefix. Allowed '', 'core', 'mvc', 'l', 'form', 'table'
    "!                         ('' is sap.m default). Variants: sap.m.semantic.FavoriteAction ('') |
    "!                         aggregation:favoriteAction (''). Pass prefix directly.
