    "!                         documentation. Default: .
    "! @parameter press                        | (event) The event is triggered when the feed content is pressed.
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS feed_content
      IMPORTING
