    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.upload.FilePreviewDialog</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.upload.FilePreviewDialog
    "! Overview Dialog with a carousel to preview files uploaded using the
    "! UploadSetwithTable control. This Element should only be used within the
    "! UploadSetwithTable Plugin as an association. Supported File Types for Preview
    "! The following file types are supported for preview: Image (PNG, JPEG, BMP, GIF)
    "! PDF Text (Txt) Video (MP4, QuickTime, WebM, OGG) — playback depends on browser
    "! codec support. SAP 3D Visual models (VDS) — requires sap.ui.vk and WebGL
    "! support.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter show_carousel_arrows         | (boolean) Show or hide carousel's arrows. Default: true.
    "! @parameter max_file_sizefor_preview     | (float) Size limit of the file in megabytes that is allowed to be
    "!                         previewed. If not set, files of any size can be previewed.
    "! @parameter custom_page_content_handler  | (function) Callback function to insert custom content into the preview
    "!                         dialog using a control to display the preview of unsupported file types.
    "!                         Use this property as callback function to insert a control with the content
    "!                         into the preview dialog. Callback function returns a promise that resolves
    "!                         with a control that is displayed in the preview dialog. Reject the promise
    "!                         to display the default illustrated message. Callback function is invoked
    "!                         with item for each unsupported file type. Example: There is a file with an
    "!                         xml extension and you want to display the content inside a codeeditor
    "!                         control for the file type. <UploadSetwithTable> <upload:FilePreviewDialog
    "!                         customPageContentHandler=" onCustomContentHandler
    "!                         "></upload:FilePreviewDialog> </UploadSetwithTable> onCustomContentHandler:
    "!                         function(oItem) return new Promise(function(resolve, reject) switch
    "!                         (oItem.getMediaType().toLowerCase()) case "application/xml": var
    "!                         oCodeEditor = new CodeEditor( value: "XML content", width: "100%", height:
    "!                         "100%" ); resolve(oCodeEditor); break; default: reject(); // reject the
    "!                         promise to display the default illustrated message. break; );
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS file_preview_dialog
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        show_carousel_arrows         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        max_file_sizefor_preview     TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        custom_page_content_handler  TYPE clike OPTIONAL
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

