    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.semantic.FilterAction</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.semantic.FilterAction
    "! A FilterAction is a sap.m.Button control enhanced with styling according to the
    "! semantics of a common "Filter" action. A FilterAction cannot be used
    "! independently but only as aggregation content of a sap.m.semantic.SemanticPage.
    "! Your app should listen to the press event of sap.m.semantic.FilterAction in
    "! order to trigger the display of the filtering options. If your filtering options
    "! are a simple list of items and require single choice only, then you can consider
    "! using a sap.m.semantic.FilterSelect instead.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter enabled                      | (boolean) See sap.m.Button enabled Default: true.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) See sap.ui.core.Control visible Default: true.
    "! @parameter press                        | (event) See sap.m.Button event:press
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS filter_action
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        enabled                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        press                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

