    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.FlexItemData</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.FlexItemData
    "! Holds layout data for a FlexBox / HBox / VBox.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter align_self                   | (sap.m.FlexAlignSelf) Determines cross-axis alignment of individual
    "!                         element. Default: Auto.
    "! @parameter order                        | (int) Determines the display order of flex items independent of their
    "!                         source code order. Default: 0.
    "! @parameter grow_factor                  | (float) Determines the flexibility of the flex item when allocatable space
    "!                         is remaining. Default: 0.
    "! @parameter shrink_factor                | (float) The shrink factor determines how much the flex item will shrink
    "!                         relative to the rest of the flex items in the flex container when negative
    "!                         free space is distributed. Default: 1.
    "! @parameter base_size                    | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) The base size is the initial main size of the item
    "!                         for the flex algorithm. If set to "auto", this will be the computed size of
    "!                         the item. Default: auto.
    "! @parameter min_height                   | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) The minimum height of the flex item. Default: auto.
    "! @parameter max_height                   | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) The maximum height of the flex item.
    "! @parameter min_width                    | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) The minimum width of the flex item. Default: auto.
    "! @parameter max_width                    | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) The maximum width of the flex item.
    "! @parameter style_class                  | (string) The style class will be applied to the flex item and can be used
    "!                         for CSS selectors.
    "! @parameter background_design            | (sap.m.BackgroundDesign) Defines the background style of the flex item.
