    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.ui.layout.form.FormLayout</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.ui.layout.form.FormLayout
    "! Base layout to render a Form . Other layouts to render a Form must inherit from
    "! this one. Note: This control must not be used to render a Form in productive
    "! applications as it does not fulfill any design guidelines and usability
    "! standards.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter background_design            | (sap.ui.layout.BackgroundDesign) Specifies the background color of the Form
    "!                         content. Note: The visualization of the different options depends on the
    "!                         theme used. Default: Translucent.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
    "!                         false, a placeholder will be rendered to mark the location of the invisible
    "!                         control in the DOM of the current page. The placeholder will be hidden and
    "!                         have zero dimensions ( display: none ). Also see InvisibleRenderer.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter field_group_ids              | (string[]) The IDs of a logical field group that this control belongs to.
    "!                         All fields in a logical field group should share the same fieldGroupId .
    "!                         Once a logical field group is left, the validateFieldGroup event is fired.
    "!                         For backward compatibility with older releases, field group IDs are
    "!                         syntactically not limited, but it is suggested to use only valid
    "!                         sap.ui.core.IDs. See attachValidateFieldGroup or consult the Field Group
    "!                         documentation. Default: .
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS form_layout
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        background_design            TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_delay         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_size          TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        field_group_ids              TYPE clike OPTIONAL
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.FormattedText</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.FormattedText
    "! The FormattedText control allows the usage of a limited set of tags for inline
    "! display of formatted text in HTML format.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter html_text                    | (string) Text in HTML format. The following tags are supported: a abbr bdi
    "!                         blockquote br cite code em h1 h2 h3 h4 h5 h6 p pre strong span u s dl dt dd
    "!                         ul ol li style, dir and target attributes are allowed. If target is not
    "!                         set, links open in a new window by default. Only safe href attributes can
    "!                         be used. See URLListValidator. Note: Keep in mind that not supported HTML
    "!                         tags and the content nested inside them are both not rendered by the
    "!                         control.
    "! @parameter width                        | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Optional width of the control in CSS units.
    "! @parameter convert_links_to_anchor_tags | (sap.m.LinkConversion) Determines whether strings that appear to be links
    "!                         will be converted to HTML anchor tags, and what are the criteria for
    "!                         recognizing them. Default: None.
    "! @parameter converted_links_default_target | (string) Determines the target attribute of the generated HTML anchor tags.
    "!                         Note: Applicable only if ConvertLinksToAnchorTags property is used with a
    "!                         value other than sap.m.LinkConversion.None . Options are the standard
    "!                         values for the target attribute of the HTML anchor tag: _self , _top ,
    "!                         _blank , _parent , _search . Default: _blank.
    "! @parameter height                       | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Optional height of the control in CSS units.
    "! @parameter text_direction               | (sap.ui.core.TextDirection) Defines the directionality of the text in the
    "!                         FormattedText , e.g. right-to-left( RTL ) or left-to-right ( LTR ). Note:
    "!                         This functionality if set to the root element. Use the bdi element and the
    "!                         dir attribute to set explicit direction to an element. Default: Inherit.
    "! @parameter text_align                   | (sap.ui.core.TextAlign) Determines the text alignment in the text elements
    "!                         in the FormattedText . Note: This functionality if set to the root element.
    "!                         To set explicit alignment to an element use the style attribute. Default:
    "!                         Begin.
    "! @parameter disable_style_attribute      | (boolean) Disables rendering of the style attribute in the FormattedText .
    "!                         Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
    "!                         false, a placeholder will be rendered to mark the location of the invisible
    "!                         control in the DOM of the current page. The placeholder will be hidden and
    "!                         have zero dimensions ( display: none ). Also see InvisibleRenderer.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter field_group_ids              | (string[]) The IDs of a logical field group that this control belongs to.
    "!                         All fields in a logical field group should share the same fieldGroupId .
    "!                         Once a logical field group is left, the validateFieldGroup event is fired.
    "!                         For backward compatibility with older releases, field group IDs are
    "!                         syntactically not limited, but it is suggested to use only valid
    "!                         sap.ui.core.IDs. See attachValidateFieldGroup or consult the Field Group
    "!                         documentation. Default: .
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS formatted_text
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        html_text                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        width                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        convert_links_to_anchor_tags TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        converted_links_default_target TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        height                       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        text_direction               TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        text_align                   TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        disable_style_attribute      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_delay         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_size          TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        field_group_ids              TYPE clike OPTIONAL
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

