    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter title                        | (string) See sap.m.Page title
    "! @parameter title_level                  | (sap.ui.core.TitleLevel) See sap.m.Page titleLevel Default: Auto.
    "! @parameter show_nav_button              | (boolean) See sap.m.Page showNavButton Default: false.
    "! @parameter show_sub_header              | (boolean) See sap.m.Page showSubHeader Default: true.
    "! @parameter enable_scrolling             | (boolean) See sap.m.Page enableScrolling Default: true.
    "! @parameter show_footer                  | (boolean) Hides or shows the page footer Default: true.
    "! @parameter floating_footer              | (boolean) Determines whether the floating footer behavior is enabled. If
    "!                         set to true , the content is visible when it's underneath the footer.
    "!                         Default: false.
    "! @parameter semantic_rule_set            | (sap.m.semantic.SemanticRuleSetType) Declares the type of semantic ruleset
    "!                         that will govern the styling and positioning of semantic content. Default:
    "!                         Classic.
    "! @parameter background_design            | (sap.m.PageBackgroundDesign) Determines the backgound color of the page.
    "!                         For more information, see sap.m.Page backgroundDesign. Default: Standard.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
