    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.GenericTag</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.GenericTag
    "! The sap.m.GenericTag control displays app-specific, essential information.
    "! Structure The control consists of four different parts: Status indicator with
    "! semantic colors (required) Icon that is displayed in the same color as the
    "! status indicator (optional) Text that is truncated automatically (required)
    "! Content area that can display either a control of type sap.m.ObjectNumber or a
    "! warning icon (optional)
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter text                         | (string) Defines the text rendered by the control. It's a value-descriptive
    "!                         text rendered on one line.
    "! @parameter status                       | (sap.ui.core.ValueState) Determines the control status that is represented
    "!                         in different colors, including the color bar and the color and type of the
    "!                         displayed icon. Default: None.
    "! @parameter design                       | (sap.m.GenericTagDesign) Determines the visual mode of the control.
    "!                         Default: Full.
    "! @parameter value_state                  | (sap.m.GenericTagValueState) Determines the state of the control. Note:
    "!                         When the error state is set, a warning type of icon is displayed that
    "!                         overrides the control set through the value aggregation. Default: None.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
    "!                         false, a placeholder will be rendered to mark the location of the invisible
    "!                         control in the DOM of the current page. The placeholder will be hidden and
    "!                         have zero dimensions ( display: none ). Also see InvisibleRenderer.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter field_group_ids              | (string[]) The IDs of a logical field group that this control belongs to.
    "!                         All fields in a logical field group should share the same fieldGroupId .
    "!                         Once a logical field group is left, the validateFieldGroup event is fired.
    "!                         For backward compatibility with older releases, field group IDs are
    "!                         syntactically not limited, but it is suggested to use only valid
    "!                         sap.ui.core.IDs. See attachValidateFieldGroup or consult the Field Group
    "!                         documentation. Default: .
    "! @parameter press                        | (event) Fired when the user clicks/taps on the control.
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS generic_tag
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        text                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        status                       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        design                       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        value_state                  TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_delay         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_size          TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        field_group_ids              TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        press                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        PREFERRED PARAMETER text
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.GenericTile</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.GenericTile
    "! Displays header, subheader, and a customizable main area in a tile format. Since
    "! 1.44, also an in-line format which contains only header and subheader is
    "! supported.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter mode                         | (sap.m.GenericTileMode) The mode of the GenericTile. Default: ContentMode.
    "! @parameter header                       | (string) The header of the tile.
    "! @parameter subheader                    | (string) The subheader of the tile.
    "! @parameter failed_text                  | (string) The message that appears when the control is in the Failed state.
    "! @parameter frame_type                   | (sap.m.FrameType) The FrameType: OneByOne, TwoByOne, OneByHalf, or
    "!                         TwoByHalf. Default set to OneByOne if property is not defined or set to
    "!                         Auto by the app. Default: OneByOne.
    "! @parameter system_info                  | (string) Backend system context information
    "! @parameter app_shortcut                 | (string) Application information such as ID/Shortcut
    "! @parameter background_image             | (sap.ui.core.URI) The URI of the background image.
    "! @parameter header_image                 | (sap.ui.core.URI) The image to be displayed as a graphical element within
    "!                         the header. This can be an image or an icon from the icon font.
    "! @parameter state                        | (sap.m.LoadState) The load status. Default: Loaded.
    "! @parameter image_description            | (string) Description of a header image that is used in the tooltip.
    "! @parameter scope                        | (sap.m.GenericTileScope) Changes the visualization in order to enable
    "!                         additional actions with the Generic Tile. Default: Display.
    "! @parameter size_behavior                | (sap.m.TileSizeBehavior) If set to TileSizeBehavior.Small , the tile size
    "!                         is the same as it would be on a small-screened phone (374px wide and
    "!                         lower), regardless of the screen size of the actual device being used. If
    "!                         set to TileSizeBehavior.Responsive , the tile size adapts to the size of
    "!                         the screen. Default: Responsive.
    "! @parameter aria_label                   | (string) Additional description for aria-label. The aria-label is rendered
    "!                         before the standard aria-label.
    "! @parameter aria_role                    | (string) Additional description for aria-role. **Note:** When the control
    "!                         is placed inside a sap.f.GridContainer , its accessibility role is
    "!                         overridden by the accessibility role specified by the sap.f.GridContainer .
    "! @parameter aria_role_description        | (string) Additional description for aria-roledescription.
    "! @parameter url                          | (sap.ui.core.URI) Renders the given link as root element and therefore
    "!                         enables the open in new tab / window functionality
    "! @parameter enable_navigation_button     | (boolean) Renders the given link as a button, enabling the option of
    "!                         opening the link in new tab/window functionality. Works only in
    "!                         ArticleMode. Default: false.
    "! @parameter press_enabled                | (boolean) Disables press event for the tile control. Default: true.
    "! @parameter navigation_button_text       | (string) Text for navigate action button. Default Value is "Read More".
    "!                         Works only in ArticleMode.
    "! @parameter wrapping_type                | (sap.m.WrappingType) Defines the type of text wrapping to be used
    "!                         (hyphenated or normal). Default: Normal.
    "! @parameter width                        | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Width of the control.
    "! @parameter additional_tooltip           | (string) Tooltip text which is added at the tooltip generated by the
    "!                         control.
    "! @parameter tile_icon                    | (sap.ui.core.URI) Icon of the GenericTile. Only applicable for IconMode.
    "! @parameter background_color             | (string) Background color of the GenericTile. Only applicable for IconMode.
    "!                         Default: ...see text or source.
    "! @parameter value_color                  | (sap.m.ValueColor) The semantic color of the value. Default: None.
    "! @parameter icon_loaded                  | (boolean) The load state of the tileIcon. Default: true.
    "! @parameter render_on_theme_change       | (boolean) The Tile rerenders on theme change. Default: false.
    "! @parameter tile_badge                   | (string) Show Badge Information associated with a Tile. Limited to 3
    "!                         characters. When enabled, the badge information is displayed inside a
    "!                         folder icon. Display limited only for tile in IconMode in TwoByHalf
    "!                         frameType. Characters currently trimmed to 3.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
    "!                         false, a placeholder will be rendered to mark the location of the invisible
    "!                         control in the DOM of the current page. The placeholder will be hidden and
    "!                         have zero dimensions ( display: none ). Also see InvisibleRenderer.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter field_group_ids              | (string[]) The IDs of a logical field group that this control belongs to.
    "!                         All fields in a logical field group should share the same fieldGroupId .
