    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.ui.layout.Grid</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.ui.layout.Grid
    "! A layout control which positions its child controls in a 12 column flow layout.
    "! The Grid control's children can be specified to take on a variable amount of
    "! columns depending on available screen size. With this control it is possible to
    "! achieve flexible layouts and line-breaks for extra large-, large-, medium- and
    "! small-sized screens, such as large desktop, desktop, tablet, and mobile. The
    "! Grid control's width can be percentage- or pixel-based and the spacing between
    "! its columns can be set to various predefined values. Notes: The visibility of
    "! the child control does not affect the horizontal space it occupies, meaning that
    "! even if the control is not visible, its horizontal space still exists, even if
    "! it is empty. If it gets wider, the content of the columns is designed to
    "! overflow outside of its dimensions. An additional sapUiRespGridOverflowHidden
    "! CSS class should be added to the control in order to hide the overflowing part
    "! of it.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter width                        | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Optional. Defines the width of the Grid . If not
    "!                         specified, then 100%. Default: 100%.
    "! @parameter v_spacing                    | (float) Optional. Defines the vertical spacing between the rows in the Grid
    "!                         . In rem, allowed values are 0, 0.5, 1 and 2. Default: 1.
    "! @parameter h_spacing                    | (float) Optional. Defines the horizontal spacing between the content in the
    "!                         Grid . In rem, allowed values are 0, 0.5 , 1 or 2. Default: 1.
    "! @parameter position                     | (sap.ui.layout.GridPosition) Optional. Defines the position of the Grid in
    "!                         the window or surrounding container. Default: Left.
    "! @parameter default_span                 | (sap.ui.layout.GridSpan) Optional. A string type that represents the span
    "!                         values of the Grid for large, medium and small screens. Allowed values are
    "!                         separated by space with case insensitive Letters XL, L, M or S followed by
    "!                         number of columns from 1 to 12 that the container has to take, for example,
    "!                         L2 M4 S6 , M12 , s10 or l4 m4 . Note: The parameters must be provided in
    "!                         the order . Default: XL3 L3 M6 S12.
    "! @parameter default_indent               | (sap.ui.layout.GridIndent) Optional. Defines default for the whole Grid
    "!                         numbers of empty columns before the current span begins. It can be defined
    "!                         for large, medium and small screens. Allowed values are separated by space
    "!                         with case insensitive Letters XL, L, M or S followed by number of columns
    "!                         from 0 to 11 that the container has to take, for example, L2 M4 S6 , M11 ,
    "!                         s10 or l4 m4 . Note: The parameters must be provided in the order .
    "!                         Default: XL0 L0 M0 S0.
    "! @parameter container_query              | (boolean) If set to true , the current range (large, medium or small) is
    "!                         defined by the size of the container surrounding the Grid instead of the
    "!                         device screen size (media Query). Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
    "!                         false, a placeholder will be rendered to mark the location of the invisible
    "!                         control in the DOM of the current page. The placeholder will be hidden and
    "!                         have zero dimensions ( display: none ). Also see InvisibleRenderer.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter field_group_ids              | (string[]) The IDs of a logical field group that this control belongs to.
    "!                         All fields in a logical field group should share the same fieldGroupId .
    "!                         Once a logical field group is left, the validateFieldGroup event is fired.
    "!                         For backward compatibility with older releases, field group IDs are
    "!                         syntactically not limited, but it is suggested to use only valid
    "!                         sap.ui.core.IDs. See attachValidateFieldGroup or consult the Field Group
    "!                         documentation. Default: .
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS grid
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        width                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        v_spacing                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        h_spacing                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        position                     TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        default_span                 TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        default_indent               TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        container_query              TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_delay         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_size          TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        field_group_ids              TYPE clike OPTIONAL
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.ui.layout.form.GridContainerData</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.ui.layout.form.GridContainerData
    "! The GridLayout -specific layout data for FormContainers .
