    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.ui.layout.GridData</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.ui.layout.GridData
    "! Defines layout data for the sap.ui.layout.Grid. Note: When GridData is used for
    "! controls inside a form, the linebreak property has to be set to true if the next
    "! form element has to be displayed on a new line. Otherwise the GridData overrides
    "! the layout provided by the Form .
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter span                         | (sap.ui.layout.GridSpan) A string type that represents the span values of
    "!                         the Grid for large, medium and small screens. Allowed values are separated
    "!                         by space with case insensitive Letters XL, L, M or S followed by number of
    "!                         columns from 1 to 12 that the container has to take, for example: L2 M4 S6
    "!                         , M12 , s10 or l4 m4 . Note: The parameters must be provided in the order .
    "! @parameter span_xl                      | (int) Optional. Defines a span value for extra large screens. This value
    "!                         overwrites the value for extra large screens defined in the span property.
    "! @parameter span_l                       | (int) Optional. Defines a span value for large screens. This value
    "!                         overwrites the value for large screens defined in the span property.
    "! @parameter span_m                       | (int) Optional. Defines a span value for medium size screens. This value
    "!                         overwrites the value for medium screens defined in the span property.
    "! @parameter span_s                       | (int) Optional. Defines a span value for small screens. This value
    "!                         overwrites the value for small screens defined in the span property.
    "! @parameter indent                       | (sap.ui.layout.GridIndent) A string type that represents the indent values
    "!                         of the Grid for large, medium and small screens. Allowed values are
    "!                         separated by space with case insensitive Letters XL, L, M or S followed by
    "!                         number of columns from 1 to 11 that the container has to take, for example,
    "!                         L2 M4 S6 , M11 , s10 or l4 m4 . Note: The parameters must be provided in
    "!                         the order .
    "! @parameter indent_xl                    | (int) Optional. Defines an indent value for extra large screens. This value
    "!                         overwrites the value for extra large screens defined in the indent
    "!                         property.
    "! @parameter indent_l                     | (int) Optional. Defines an indent value for large screens. This value
    "!                         overwrites the value for large screens defined in the indent property.
    "! @parameter indent_m                     | (int) Optional. Defines an indent value for medium size screens. This value
    "!                         overwrites the value for medium screens defined in the indent property.
    "! @parameter indent_s                     | (int) Optional. Defines an indent value for small screens. This value
    "!                         overwrites the value for small screens defined in the indent property.
    "! @parameter visible_xl                   | (boolean) Defines if this control is visible on extra Large screens.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter visible_l                    | (boolean) Defines if this control is visible on large screens. Default:
    "!                         true.
    "! @parameter visible_m                    | (boolean) Defines if this control is visible on medium screens. Default:
    "!                         true.
    "! @parameter visible_s                    | (boolean) Defines if this control is visible on small screens. Default:
    "!                         true.
    "! @parameter move_backwards               | (sap.ui.layout.GridIndent) Optional. Moves a cell backwards with as many
    "!                         columns as specified.
    "! @parameter move_forward                 | (sap.ui.layout.GridIndent) Optional. Moves a cell forwards with as many
    "!                         columns as specified.
    "! @parameter linebreak                    | (boolean) Optional. If set to true , the control causes a line break on
    "!                         all-size screens within the Grid and becomes the first within the next
    "!                         line. Default: false.
    "! @parameter linebreak_xl                 | (boolean) Optional. If set to true , the control causes a line break on
    "!                         extra large screens within the Grid and becomes the first within the next
    "!                         line. Default: false.
    "! @parameter linebreak_l                  | (boolean) Optional. If set to true , the control causes a line break on
    "!                         large screens within the Grid and becomes the first within the next line.
    "!                         Default: false.
    "! @parameter linebreak_m                  | (boolean) Optional. If set to true , the control causes a line break on
    "!                         medium screens within the Grid and becomes the first within the next line.
    "!                         Default: false.
    "! @parameter linebreak_s                  | (boolean) Optional. If set to true , the control causes a line break on
    "!                         small screens within the Grid and becomes the first within the next line.
    "!                         Default: false.
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS grid_data
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        span                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        span_xl                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        span_l                       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        span_m                       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        span_s                       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        indent                       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        indent_xl                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        indent_l                     TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        indent_m                     TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        indent_s                     TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible_xl                   TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible_l                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible_m                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible_s                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        move_backwards               TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        move_forward                 TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        linebreak                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        linebreak_xl                 TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        linebreak_l                  TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        linebreak_m                  TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        linebreak_s                  TYPE clike OPTIONAL
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.ui.layout.form.GridElementData</p>
