    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">Duplicate: label (2 variants) -> ns</p>
    "! - sap.m.Label (ns='')
    "! - Aggregation <label> (ns='')
    "! Namespace prefixes: '' = sap.m, 'core' = sap.ui.core, 'mvc' = sap.ui.core.mvc, 'l' = sap.ui.layout, 'form' = sap.ui.layout.form, 'table' = sap.ui.table
    "! @parameter ns                           | (string) Namespace prefix. Allowed '', 'core', 'mvc', 'l', 'form', 'table'
    "!                         ('' is sap.m default). Variants: sap.m.Label ('') | aggregation:label ('').
    "!                         Pass prefix directly.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter design                       | (sap.m.LabelDesign) Sets the design of a Label to either Standard or Bold.
    "!                         Default: Standard.
    "! @parameter text                         | (string) Determines the Label text to be displayed.
    "! @parameter text_align                   | (sap.ui.core.TextAlign) Available alignment settings are "Begin", "Center",
    "!                         "End", "Left", and "Right". Default: Begin.
    "! @parameter text_direction               | (sap.ui.core.TextDirection) Options for the text direction are RTL and LTR.
    "!                         Alternatively, the control can inherit the text direction from its parent
    "!                         container. Default: Inherit.
    "! @parameter width                        | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Determines the width of the label.
    "! @parameter required                     | (boolean) Indicates that user input is required for input control labeled
    "!                         by the sap.m.Label. When the property is set to true and associated input
    "!                         field is empty an asterisk character is added to the label text. Default:
    "!                         false.
    "! @parameter display_only                 | (boolean) Determines if the label is in displayOnly mode. Note: This
    "!                         property should be used only in Form controls in preview mode. Default:
    "!                         false.
    "! @parameter wrapping                     | (boolean) Determines the wrapping of the text within the Label . When set
    "!                         to false (default), the label text will be truncated and and an ellipsis
    "!                         will be added at the end. If set to true , the label text will wrap.
    "!                         Default: false.
    "! @parameter wrapping_type                | (sap.m.WrappingType) Defines the type of text wrapping to be used
    "!                         (hyphenated or normal). Note: This property takes effect only when the
    "!                         wrapping property is set to true . Default: Normal.
    "! @parameter v_align                      | (sap.ui.core.VerticalAlign) Specifies the vertical alignment of the Label
    "!                         related to the tallest and lowest element on the line. Default: Inherit.
    "! @parameter show_colon                   | (boolean) Defines whether a colon (:) character is added to the label.
    "!                         Note: By default when the Label is in the sap.ui.layout.form.Form and
    "!                         sap.ui.layout.form.SimpleForm controls the colon (:) character is displayed
    "!                         automatically regardless of the value of the showColon property. Default:
    "!                         false.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
