    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.ui.table.plugins.ODataV4Aggregation</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.ui.table.plugins.ODataV4Aggregation
    "! Integrates the information about the data structure of the
    "! sap.ui.model.odata.v4.ODataListBinding and the table. The table is enabled to
    "! visualize grouped data with summary rows. Works only in combination with a
    "! sap.ui.model.odata.v4.ODataModel. For details about data aggregation, see
    "! sap.ui.model.odata.v4.ODataListBinding setAggregation. In combination with the
    "! Table control, this plugin offers a UI for OData V4 that is similar to the one
    "! the AnalyticalTable offers for OData V2.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter enabled                      | (boolean) Indicates whether this plugin is enabled. Default: true.
    "! @parameter group_header_formatter       | (function) Provides a custom group header title. This function is called
    "!                         for each group header row in the table. It receives the binding context of
    "!                         the row and the group level property path according to groupLevels in
    "!                         sap.ui.model.odata.v4.ODataListBinding setAggregation). The function must
    "!                         return a string that is used as the title of the group header row. Note:
    "!                         Setting a new formatter does not immediately update the group header
    "!                         titles. The titles are updated at the next binding update. Function
    "!                         signature: groupHeaderFormatter(oContext: sap.ui.model.odata.v4.Context,
    "!                         sPropertyPath: string): string
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS odata_v4_aggregation
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        enabled                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        group_header_formatter       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

