    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.P13nColumnsPanel</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.P13nColumnsPanel
    "! The P13nColumnsPanel control is used to define column-specific settings for
    "! table personalization.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter visible_items_threshold      | (int) Specifies a threshold of visible items. If the end user makes a lot
    "!                         of columns visible, this might cause performance to slow down. When this
    "!                         happens, the user can receive a corresponding warning triggered by the
    "!                         visibleItemsThreshold property. The property needs to be activated and set
    "!                         to the required value by the consuming application to ensure that the
    "!                         warning message is shown when the threshold has been exceeded. In the
    "!                         following example the message will be shown if more than 100 visible
    "!                         columns are selected: customData> core:CustomData key="p13nDialogSettings"
    "!                         value='\ "columns":\ "visible": true, "payload": \ "visibleItemsThreshold":
    "!                         3\ \ \ ' /> /customData> Default: -1.
    "! @parameter title                        | (string) Title text appears in the panel.
    "! @parameter title_large                  | (string) Large title text appears e.g. in dialog header in case that only
    "!                         one panel is shown.
    "! @parameter type                         | (string) Panel type for generic use. Due to extensibility reason the type
    "!                         of type property should be string . So it is feasible to add a custom panel
    "!                         without expanding the type.
    "! @parameter vertical_scrolling           | (boolean) Enables the vertical Scrolling on the P13nDialog when the panel
    "!                         is shown. Default: true.
    "! @parameter validation_executor          | (object) Callback method which is called in order to validate end user
    "!                         entry.
    "! @parameter validation_listener          | (object) Callback method which is called in order to register for
    "!                         validation result.
    "! @parameter change_notifier              | (object) Callback which notifies a change on this panel.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
    "!                         false, a placeholder will be rendered to mark the location of the invisible
    "!                         control in the DOM of the current page. The placeholder will be hidden and
    "!                         have zero dimensions ( display: none ). Also see InvisibleRenderer.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter field_group_ids              | (string[]) The IDs of a logical field group that this control belongs to.
    "!                         All fields in a logical field group should share the same fieldGroupId .
    "!                         Once a logical field group is left, the validateFieldGroup event is fired.
    "!                         For backward compatibility with older releases, field group IDs are
    "!                         syntactically not limited, but it is suggested to use only valid
    "!                         sap.ui.core.IDs. See attachValidateFieldGroup or consult the Field Group
    "!                         documentation. Default: .
    "! @parameter change_columns_items         | (event) Event raised if columnsItems is changed or new one needs to be
    "!                         created in the model.
    "! @parameter before_navigation_to         | (event) Due to performance the data of the panel can be requested in lazy
    "!                         mode e.g. when the panel is displayed
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS p13n_columns_panel
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible_items_threshold      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        title                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        title_large                  TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        type                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        vertical_scrolling           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        validation_executor          TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        validation_listener          TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        change_notifier              TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_delay         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_size          TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        field_group_ids              TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        change_columns_items         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        before_navigation_to         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        PREFERRED PARAMETER title
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.P13nConditionPanel</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.P13nConditionPanel
    "! The ConditionPanel Control will be used to implement the Sorting, Filtering and
    "! Grouping panel of the new Personalization dialog.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter max_conditions               | (string) defines the max number of conditions on the ConditionPanel
    "!                         Default: -1.
    "! @parameter exclude                      | (boolean) exclude options for filter Default: false.
    "! @parameter container_query              | (boolean) defines if the mediaQuery or a ContainerResize will be used for
    "!                         layout update. When the P13nConditionPanel is used on a dialog the property
    "!                         should be set to true ! Default: false.
    "! @parameter auto_add_new_row             | (boolean) adds initial a new empty condition row Default: false.
    "! @parameter disable_first_remove_icon    | (boolean) makes the remove icon on the first condition row disabled when
    "!                         only one condition exist. Default: false.
    "! @parameter always_show_add_icon         | (boolean) makes the Add icon visible on each condition row. If is set to
    "!                         false the Add is only visible at the end and you can only append a new
    "!                         condition. Default: true.
    "! @parameter use_prev_condition_setting   | (boolean) new added condition use the settings from the previous condition
    "!                         as default. Default: true.
    "! @parameter auto_reduce_key_field_items  | (boolean) KeyField value can only be selected once. When you set the
    "!                         property to true the ConditionPanel will automatically offers on the
    "!                         KeyField drop down only the keyFields which are not used. The default
    "!                         behavior is that in each keyField dropdown all keyfields are listed.
    "!                         Default: false.
    "! @parameter layout_mode                  | (string) can be used to control the layout behavior. Default is "" which
    "!                         will automatically change the layout. With "Desktop", "Table" or "Phone"
    "!                         you can set a fixed layout.
    "! @parameter show_label                   | (boolean) show additional labels in the condition Default: false.
    "! @parameter display_format               | (string) This represents the displayFormat of the condition Values. With
    "!                         the value "UpperCase" the entered value of the condition will be converted
    "!                         to upperCase.
    "! @parameter validation_executor          | (object) Calls the validation listener tbd...
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
    "!                         false, a placeholder will be rendered to mark the location of the invisible
    "!                         control in the DOM of the current page. The placeholder will be hidden and
    "!                         have zero dimensions ( display: none ). Also see InvisibleRenderer.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter field_group_ids              | (string[]) The IDs of a logical field group that this control belongs to.
    "!                         All fields in a logical field group should share the same fieldGroupId .
    "!                         Once a logical field group is left, the validateFieldGroup event is fired.
    "!                         For backward compatibility with older releases, field group IDs are
    "!                         syntactically not limited, but it is suggested to use only valid
    "!                         sap.ui.core.IDs. See attachValidateFieldGroup or consult the Field Group
    "!                         documentation. Default: .
    "! @parameter data_change                  | (event) Workaround for updating the binding
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS p13n_condition_panel
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
