    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.P13nFilterItem</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.P13nFilterItem
    "! Type for filterItems aggregation in P13nFilterPanel control.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter operation                    | (string) sap.m.P13nConditionOperation
    "! @parameter value1                       | (string) value of the filter
    "! @parameter value2                       | (string) to value of the between filter
    "! @parameter column_key                   | (string) key of the column
    "! @parameter exclude                      | (boolean) defines if the filter is an include or exclude filter item
    "!                         Default: false.
    "! @parameter text                         | (string) The text to be displayed for the item.
    "! @parameter enabled                      | (boolean) Enabled items can be selected. Default: true.
    "! @parameter text_direction               | (sap.ui.core.TextDirection) Options are RTL and LTR. Alternatively, an item
    "!                         can inherit its text direction from its parent control. Default: Inherit.
    "! @parameter key                          | (string) Can be used as input for subsequent actions.
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS p13n_filter_item
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        operation                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        value1                       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        value2                       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        column_key                   TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        exclude                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
