    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter max_includes                 | (string) Defines the maximum number of include filters. Default: -1.
    "! @parameter max_excludes                 | (string) Defines the maximum number of exclude filters. Default: -1.
    "! @parameter container_query              | (boolean) Defines if the mediaQuery or a ContainerResize is used for layout
    "!                         update. If the ConditionPanel is used in a dialog, the property must be set
    "!                         to true . Default: false.
    "! @parameter layout_mode                  | (string) Can be used to control the layout behavior. Default is "" which
    "!                         will automatically change the layout. With "Desktop", "Table" or"Phone" you
    "!                         can set a fixed layout.
    "! @parameter enable_empty_operations      | (boolean) Should empty operation be enabled for certain data types. This is
    "!                         also based on their nullable setting. Default: false.
    "! @parameter title                        | (string) Title text appears in the panel.
    "! @parameter title_large                  | (string) Large title text appears e.g. in dialog header in case that only
    "!                         one panel is shown.
    "! @parameter type                         | (string) Panel type for generic use. Due to extensibility reason the type
    "!                         of type property should be string . So it is feasible to add a custom panel
    "!                         without expanding the type.
    "! @parameter vertical_scrolling           | (boolean) Enables the vertical Scrolling on the P13nDialog when the panel
    "!                         is shown. Default: true.
