    "!                         pass additional type/format settings for the entered value. if type==time
    "!                         or date or datetime the object will be used for the DateFormatter,
    "!                         TimeFormatter or DateTimeFormatter Below you can find a brief example UTC:
    "!                         false, style: "medium" //"short" or "long"
