    "!                         value (maxFractionDigits of the used Formatter)
    "! @parameter max_length                   | (string) specifies the number of characters which can be entered in the
    "!                         value fields of the condition panel
    "! @parameter width                        | (string) Defines column width
    "! @parameter is_default                   | (boolean) the column with isDefault==true will be used as the selected
