    "! @parameter values                       | (string[]) the array of values for type bool. e.g. ["", "Off", "On"]. The
    "!                         first entry can be empty (used to blank the value field). Next value
    "!                         represent the false value, last entry the true value.
    "! @parameter role                         | (string) Defines role. The role is reflected in the manner how the
