    "! @parameter header_label                 | (string) Texts that describe the landmark of the header container of the
    "!                         corresponding sap.m.Page control. If not set (and a landmark different than
    "!                         sap.ui.core.AccessibleLandmarkRole.None is defined), a predefined text is
    "!                         used.
    "! @parameter sub_header_role              | (sap.ui.core.AccessibleLandmarkRole) Landmark role of the subheader
    "!                         container of the corresponding sap.m.Page control. If set to
