    "!                         used.
    "! @parameter footer_role                  | (sap.ui.core.AccessibleLandmarkRole) Landmark role of the footer container
    "!                         of the corresponding sap.m.Page control. If set to
    "!                         sap.ui.core.AccessibleLandmarkRole.None , no landmark will be added to the
