    "!                         navigates through. The minimum number of items/entities is 1. Default: 1.
    "! @parameter position                     | (int) Determines the current position in the items/entities that the
    "!                         control navigates through. Starting (minimum) number is 1. Default: 1.
    "! @parameter next_button_tooltip          | (string) Determines the tooltip of the next button.
    "! @parameter previous_button_tooltip      | (string) Determines the tooltip of the previous button.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
