    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.PlanningCalendarView</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.PlanningCalendarView
    "! View of the sap.m.PlanningCalendar. The PlanningCalendarView defines the type of
    "! the intervals (hours, days, months) and how many intervals are displayed.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter key                          | (string) Defines the key of the view. This must be set to identify the used
    "!                         view in the sap.m.PlanningCalendar.
    "! @parameter interval_type                | (sap.ui.unified.CalendarIntervalType) Determines the type of the intervals
    "!                         of the row. Note: Not all predefined interval types are supported for this
    "!                         property. For more information, see the descriptions in the
    "!                         CalendarIntervalType enumeration. Default: Hour.
    "! @parameter interval_size                | (int) An integer that defines the period size. Default: 1.
    "! @parameter interval_label_formatter     | (object) A function that formats the interval.
    "! @parameter relative                     | (boolean) Defines if the view will be relative. NOTE: Relative views, can
    "!                         be only used with intervalType - Day and when used they need intervalSize
    "!                         and intervalLabelFormatter defined. Default: false.
    "! @parameter description                  | (string) Defines the description of the PlanningCalendarView .
    "! @parameter intervals_s                  | (int) Defines the number of intervals that are displayed for a
    "!                         sap.m.PlanningCalendar that is less than 600 pixels wide. Note: On a phone
    "!                         the maximum visible intervals are 8. Default: 6.
    "! @parameter intervals_m                  | (int) Defines the number of intervals that are displayed for a
    "!                         sap.m.PlanningCalendar that is between 600 and 1024 pixels wide. Default:
    "!                         8.
