    "! @parameter show_sub_intervals           | (boolean) If set, subintervals are displayed as lines in the rows. Quarter
    "!                         hour subintervals for interval type Hour . Hour subintervals for interval
    "!                         types Day , Week and OneMonth . Day subintervals for interval type Month .
    "!                         Default: false.
    "! @parameter appointment_height           | (sap.ui.unified.CalendarAppointmentHeight) Determines the different
    "!                         possible sizes for appointments. Default: Regular.
