    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.ProgressIndicator</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.ProgressIndicator
    "! Shows the progress of a process in a graphical way. To indicate the progress,
    "! the inside of the ProgressIndicator is filled with a color. Additionally, a
    "! user-defined string can be displayed on the ProgressIndicator.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter state                        | (sap.ui.core.ValueState) Specifies the state of the bar. Enumeration
    "!                         sap.ui.core.ValueState provides Error, Warning, Success, Information, None
    "!                         (default value). The color for each state depends on the theme. Default:
    "!                         None.
    "! @parameter display_value                | (string) Specifies the text value to be displayed in the bar.
    "! @parameter percent_value                | (float) Specifies the numerical value in percent for the length of the
    "!                         progress bar. Note: If a value greater than 100 is provided, the
    "!                         percentValue is set to 100. In other cases of invalid value, percentValue
    "!                         is set to its default of 0. Default: 0.
    "! @parameter show_value                   | (boolean) Indicates whether the displayValue should be shown in the
    "!                         ProgressIndicator. Default: true.
    "! @parameter width                        | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Specifies the width of the control. Default: 100%.
    "! @parameter height                       | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Specifies the height of the control. The default
    "!                         value depends on the theme. Suggested size for normal use is 2.5rem (40px).
    "!                         Suggested size for small size (like for use in ObjectHeader) is 1.375rem
    "!                         (22px).
    "! @parameter text_direction               | (sap.ui.core.TextDirection) Specifies the element's text directionality
    "!                         with enumerated options (RTL or LTR). By default, the control inherits text
    "!                         direction from the DOM. Default: Inherit.
    "! @parameter display_only                 | (boolean) Determines whether the control is in display-only state where the
    "!                         control has different visualization and cannot be focused. Default: false.
    "! @parameter display_animation            | (boolean) Determines whether a percentage change is displayed with
    "!                         animation. Default: true.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
    "!                         false, a placeholder will be rendered to mark the location of the invisible
    "!                         control in the DOM of the current page. The placeholder will be hidden and
    "!                         have zero dimensions ( display: none ). Also see InvisibleRenderer.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter field_group_ids              | (string[]) The IDs of a logical field group that this control belongs to.
    "!                         All fields in a logical field group should share the same fieldGroupId .
    "!                         Once a logical field group is left, the validateFieldGroup event is fired.
    "!                         For backward compatibility with older releases, field group IDs are
    "!                         syntactically not limited, but it is suggested to use only valid
    "!                         sap.ui.core.IDs. See attachValidateFieldGroup or consult the Field Group
    "!                         documentation. Default: .
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS progress_indicator
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        state                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        display_value                TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        percent_value                TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        show_value                   TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        width                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        height                       TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        text_direction               TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        display_only                 TYPE clike OPTIONAL
