    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.QuickViewGroupElement</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.QuickViewGroupElement
    "! QuickViewGroupElement is a combination of one label and another control (Link or
