    "! @parameter max_width                    | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Sets the maximum width of the control. Default: 100%.
    "! @parameter selected_key                 | (string) Key of the selected item. Note: If duplicate keys exist, the first
    "!                         item matching the key is used.
