    "! sap.suite.ui.commons.ChartContainer and sap.ui.comp.smartchart.SmartChart
    "! controls. Initially, the control is rendered as a button that opens the popup
    "! after clicking on it. Note: It is protected and should only be used within the
    "! framework itself.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
