    "! @parameter before_open                  | (event) Event is triggered before the popover is open.
    "! @parameter before_close                 | (event) Event is triggered before the popover is closed.
    "! @parameter navigate                     | (event) Event is triggered after a list item of sap.m.SelectionDetailsItem
    "!                         is pressed.
    "! @parameter action_press                 | (event) Event is triggered when a custom action is pressed.
