    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.SelectionDetailsItem</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.SelectionDetailsItem
    "! This protected element provides an item for sap.m.SelectionDetails that is shown
    "! inside a list. The item includes SelectionDetailsItemLine as its lines that are
    "! displayed in one block above the optional actions. Note: It is protected and
    "! should only be used within the framework itself.
