    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.SelectionDetailsItemLine</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.SelectionDetailsItemLine
    "! This Element provides a means to fill an sap.m.SelectionDetailsItem with
    "! content. It is used for a form-like display of a label followed by a value with
    "! an optional unit. If the unit is used, the value is displayed bold. Note: It is
    "! protected and should ony be used within the framework itself.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter label                        | (string) The label that is shown as the first part of the line. It may
    "!                         contain the name of the currently selected dimension or measure.
    "! @parameter value                        | (any) The value of the line, for example the value of the currently
    "!                         selected measure. Expected type is a string, number or a plain object,
    "!                         including date and time properties of type string.
    "! @parameter display_value                | (string) The display value of the line. If this property is set, it
    "!                         overrides the value property and is displayed as is.
    "! @parameter unit                         | (string) The unit of the given value. If this unit is given, the line is
    "!                         displayed bold.
    "! @parameter line_marker                  | (string) A string to be rendered by the control as a line marker. This
    "!                         string must be a valid SVG definition. The only valid tags are: svg, path,
    "!                         line.
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS selection_details_item_line
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        label                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        value                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        display_value                TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        unit                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        line_marker                  TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        PREFERRED PARAMETER value
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.p13n.SelectionPanel</p>
