    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.TileContainer</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.TileContainer
    "! A container that arranges same-size tiles nicely on carousel pages.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter width                        | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Defines the width of the TileContainer in px.
    "!                         Default: 100%.
    "! @parameter height                       | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Defines the height of the TileContainer in px.
    "!                         Default: 100%.
    "! @parameter editable                     | (boolean) Determines whether the TileContainer is editable so you can move,
    "!                         delete or add tiles.
    "! @parameter allow_add                    | (boolean) Determines whether the user is allowed to add Tiles in Edit mode
    "!                         (editable = true).
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
