    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.TileInfo</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.TileInfo
    "! This element is used within the GenericTile control that generates a combination
    "! of an icon and a text to create a TileInfo
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter src                          | (sap.ui.core.URI) This property can be set by following options: Option 1:
    "!                         The value has to be matched by following pattern
    "!                         sap-icon://collection-name/icon-name where collection-name and icon-name
    "!                         have to be replaced by the desired values. In case the default UI5 icons
    "!                         are used the collection-name can be omitted. Example: sap-icon://accept
    "!                         Option 2: The value is determined by using sap.ui.core.IconPool.getIconURI
    "!                         with an Icon name parameter and an optional collection parameter which is
    "!                         required when using application extended Icons. Example:
    "!                         IconPool.getIconURI("accept")
    "! @parameter text                         | (string) Defines the text inside the TileInfo.
    "! @parameter text_color                   | (sap.m.TileInfoColor) Defines the text color inside the TileInfo Default:
    "!                         CriticalTextColor.
    "! @parameter background_color             | (sap.m.TileInfoColor) Defines the background color inside the TileInfo
    "!                         Default: WarningBackground.
    "! @parameter border_color                 | (sap.m.TileInfoColor) Defines the border color of the TileInfo Default:
    "!                         WarningBorderColor.
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS tile_info
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        src                          TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        text                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        text_color                   TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        background_color             TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        border_color                 TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        PREFERRED PARAMETER text
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

