        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.Tokenizer</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.Tokenizer
    "! Overview A Тokenizer is a container for Tokens. The tokenizer supports keyboard
    "! navigation and token selection. It also handles all actions associated with the
    "! tokens like adding, deleting, selecting and editing. Structure The tokenizer
    "! consists of two parts: - Tokens - displays the available tokens. - N-more
    "! indicator - contains the number of the remaining tokens that cannot be displayed
    "! due to the limited space. The tokens are stored in the tokens aggregation. The
    "! tokenizer can determine, by setting the editable property, whether the tokens in
    "! it are editable. Still the Token itself can determine if it is editable . This
    "! allows you to have non-editable Tokens in an editable Tokenizer.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter editable                     | (boolean) true if tokens shall be editable otherwise false Default: true.
    "! @parameter enabled                      | (boolean) Defines if the Tokenizer is enabled Default: true.
    "! @parameter width                        | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Defines the width of the Tokenizer.
    "! @parameter max_width                    | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Defines the maximum width of the Tokenizer. Default:
    "!                         100%.
    "! @parameter render_mode                  | (string) Defines the mode that the Tokenizer will use:
    "!                         sap.m.TokenizerRenderMode.Loose mode shows all tokens, no matter the width
    "!                         of the Tokenizer sap.m.TokenizerRenderMode.Narrow mode forces the Tokenizer
    "!                         to show only as much tokens as possible in its width and add an n-More
    "!                         indicator Note : Have in mind that the renderMode property is used
    "!                         internally by the Tokenizer and controls that use the Tokenizer. Therefore,
    "!                         modifying this property may alter the expected behavior of the control.
    "!                         Default: sap.m.TokenizerRenderMode.Narrow.
    "! @parameter name                         | (string) The name property to be used in the HTML code for the tokenizer
    "!                         (e.g. for HTML forms that send data to the server via submit).
    "! @parameter display_only                 | (boolean) Determines whether the Tokenizer is in display only state. When
    "!                         set to true , the Tokenizer is not editable. This setting is used for forms
    "!                         in review mode. Default: false.
    "! @parameter multi_line                   | (boolean) Defines whether tokens are displayed on multiple lines. Default:
    "!                         false.
    "! @parameter show_clear_all               | (boolean) Defines whether "Clear All" button is present. Ensure `multiLine`
    "!                         is enabled, otherwise `showClearAll` will have no effect. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
    "!                         false, a placeholder will be rendered to mark the location of the invisible
    "!                         control in the DOM of the current page. The placeholder will be hidden and
    "!                         have zero dimensions ( display: none ). Also see InvisibleRenderer.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter field_group_ids              | (string[]) The IDs of a logical field group that this control belongs to.
    "!                         All fields in a logical field group should share the same fieldGroupId .
    "!                         Once a logical field group is left, the validateFieldGroup event is fired.
    "!                         For backward compatibility with older releases, field group IDs are
    "!                         syntactically not limited, but it is suggested to use only valid
    "!                         sap.ui.core.IDs. See attachValidateFieldGroup or consult the Field Group
    "!                         documentation. Default: .
    "! @parameter token_delete                 | (event) Fired when a token is deleted by clicking icon, pressing backspace
    "!                         or delete button. Once the event is fired, application is responsible for
    "!                         removing / destroying the token from the aggregation.
    "! @parameter render_mode_change           | (event) Fired when the render mode of the Tokenizer changes between Narrow
    "!                         (collapsed) and Loose (expanded).
    "! @parameter result                       | (REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder) Reference to builder
    METHODS tokenizer
      IMPORTING
        id                           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        class                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        editable                     TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        enabled                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        width                        TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        max_width                    TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        render_mode                  TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        name                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        display_only                 TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        multi_line                   TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        show_clear_all               TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy                         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_delay         TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        busy_indicator_size          TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        visible                      TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        field_group_ids              TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        token_delete                 TYPE clike OPTIONAL
        render_mode_change           TYPE clike OPTIONAL
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE REF TO z2fiori_cl_xml_view_builder.

