    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.VariantItem</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.VariantItem
    "! The VariantItem class describes a variant item.
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter sharing                      | (sap.m.SharingMode) Contains the information is the item is public or
    "!                         private. Default: Private.
