    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.ui.core.VariantLayoutData</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.ui.core.VariantLayoutData
    "! Allows to add multiple LayoutData to one control in case that an easy switch of
    "! layouts (e.g. in a Form) is needed.
