    "! <p class="shorttext synchronized" lang="en">sap.m.VariantManagement</p>
    "! https://ui5.sap.com/#/api/sap.m.VariantManagement
    "! Can be used to manage variants. You can use this control to create and maintain
    "! personalization changes. The persistency and retrieval of such changes has to be
    "! handled by the hosting application. Note: On the user interface, variants are
    "! generally referred to as "views".
    "! @parameter id                           | (string) Unique control identifier
    "! @parameter class                        | (string) CSS class names
    "! @parameter support_default              | (boolean) Indicates that default of variants is supported Default: true.
    "! @parameter support_favorites            | (boolean) Indicates that favorite handling is supported Default: true.
    "! @parameter support_apply_automatically  | (boolean) Indicates that apply automatically functionality is supported
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter support_public               | (boolean) Indicates that public functionality is supported Default: true.
    "! @parameter support_contexts             | (boolean) Indicates that contexts functionality is supported. Note: This
    "!                         property is used internally by the SAPUI5 flexibility layer. Default:
    "!                         false.
    "! @parameter selected_key                 | (string) Identifies the currently selected item
    "! @parameter default_key                  | (string) Identifies the defaulted item
    "! @parameter show_save_as                 | (boolean) Controls the visibility of the Save As button. Default: true.
    "! @parameter creation_allowed             | (boolean) If set to false , neither the Save As nor the Save button in the
    "!                         My Views dialog is visible. Default: true.
    "! @parameter show_footer                  | (boolean) Indicates if the buttons and the complete footer in the My Views
    "!                         dialog are visible. Default: true.
    "! @parameter modified                     | (boolean) Indicates if the current variant is modified. Default: false.
    "! @parameter popover_title                | (string) The title in the My Views popover.
    "! @parameter in_error_state               | (boolean) Indicates that the control is in error state. If set to true , an
    "!                         error message will be displayed whenever the variant is opened. Default:
    "!                         false.
    "! @parameter level                        | (sap.ui.core.TitleLevel) Semantic level of the header. For more
    "!                         information, see sap.m.Title setLevel. Default: Auto.
    "! @parameter title_style                  | (sap.ui.core.TitleLevel) Defines the style of the title. For more
    "!                         information, see sap.m.Title setTitleStyle. Default: Auto.
    "! @parameter max_width                    | (sap.ui.core.CSSSize) Sets the maximum width of the control. Default: 100%.
    "! @parameter busy                         | (boolean) Whether the control is currently in busy state. Default: false.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_delay         | (int) The delay in milliseconds, after which the busy indicator will show
    "!                         up for this control. Default: 1000.
    "! @parameter busy_indicator_size          | (sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize) The size of the BusyIndicator. For controls
    "!                         with a width smaller 3rem a sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Small should be
    "!                         used. If the size could vary in width and the width could get smaller than
    "!                         3rem, the sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Auto option could be used. The
    "!                         default is set to sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Medium For a full screen
    "!                         BusyIndicator use sap.ui.core.BusyIndicatorSize.Large . Default: Medium.
    "! @parameter visible                      | (boolean) Whether the control should be visible on the screen. If set to
    "!                         false, a placeholder will be rendered to mark the location of the invisible
    "!                         control in the DOM of the current page. The placeholder will be hidden and
    "!                         have zero dimensions ( display: none ). Also see InvisibleRenderer.
    "!                         Default: true.
    "! @parameter field_group_ids              | (string[]) The IDs of a logical field group that this control belongs to.
    "!                         All fields in a logical field group should share the same fieldGroupId .
    "!                         Once a logical field group is left, the validateFieldGroup event is fired.
    "!                         For backward compatibility with older releases, field group IDs are
    "!                         syntactically not limited, but it is suggested to use only valid
    "!                         sap.ui.core.IDs. See attachValidateFieldGroup or consult the Field Group
    "!                         documentation. Default: .
    "! @parameter save                         | (event) This event is fired when the Save View dialog or the Save As dialog
    "!                         is closed with the Save button.
    "! @parameter cancel                       | (event) This event is fired when users presses the cancel button inside
    "!                         Save As dialog.
    "! @parameter manage_cancel                | (event) This event is fired when users presses the cancel button inside
    "!                         Manage Views dialog.
    "! @parameter manage                       | (event) This event is fired when users apply changes variant information in
    "!                         the Manage Views dialog. Some of the parameters may be ommitted, depending
    "!                         on user selection.
    "! @parameter select                       | (event) This event is fired when a new variant is selected.
